  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive). No transitive pair. Pattern: Xが{漂|ただよ}う (X drifts/floats).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing state. {漂|ただよ}っている = 'is drifting/floating.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {海|うみ}を{漂|ただよ}う (to drift on the sea)\n- {空気|くうき}が{漂|ただよ}う (an atmosphere pervades)\n- {香|かお}りが{漂|ただよ}う (a scent wafts)\n- {霧|きり}が{漂|ただよ}う (mist drifts)\n\nNUANCE: {漂|ただよ}う implies aimless, passive movement without control, often creating a poetic or atmospheric effect.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {浮|う}く - to float (stationary on surface)\n- {流|なが}れる - to flow (with direction)\n- {舞|ま}う - to flutter, dance in air",
